Subject: [V4 PATCH 08/26] memcontrol: use N_MEMORY instead N_HIGH_MEMORY
Date: Mon, 10 Sep 2012 16:59:00 +0800
Message-Id: <1347267558-6707-9-git-send-email-laijs@cn.fujitsu.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.4.4
